{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2021-12-13 17:47:00', 'title': 'VENTAS TO PARTICIPATE IN INVESTOR MEETINGS AT JEFFERIES VIRTUAL REAL ESTATE CONFERENCE', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MANAGEMENT WILL PARTICIPATE IN INVESTOR MEETINGS AT THE JEFFERIES VIRTUAL REAL ESTATE CONFERENCE (THE “JEFFERIES CONFERENCE”) ON DECEMBER 15, 2021. ANY COMPANY WRITTEN MATERIALS ACCOMPANYING THE INVESTOR MEETINGS AT THE JEFFERIES CONFERENCE WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AFTER THE CLOSING OF TRADING ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE ON DECEMBER 14, 2021. THESE MATERIALS WILL BE ARCHIVED"}